{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25836","headline":"却渡西陵别越中父老 · 李绅","name":"却渡西陵别越中父老","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海潮晚上江风急，津吏篙师语默齐。\n倾手奉觞看故老，拥流争拜见孩提。\n慙非杜母临襄岘，自鄙朱翁别会稽。\n渐举云帆烟水阔，杳然凫雁各东西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25836.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25836","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}